  "label": "mocking contemptuous emotion",
  "description": "The emotion expressed is one of mocking contempt, conveyed through the juxtaposition of the elderly man holding a gravestone with the Ten Commandments and the overlaid text 'you're so old' and 'this was your first school book.' The tone is demeaning, implying that the person's foundational knowledge is simplistic or outdated, which is a form of contemptuous humor targeting age. The visual of the gravestone adds a layer of finality and ridicule, enhancing the mocking tone.",
